Inx\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhTErxhAooAMpYHAw8jB2N3fwdln78qh63OKHCaMcqr5HjZkR9Eg1On63-CjgX3kJmoiYLTmSUE6hqvsAFPt2_sakAORKEFhrzPuNLJX7AMqXiTo4DLag78PevsYs4QtTe493e10suX1Zk2p0gudsRYFJdsbXpTeWw3m5URjJKaJqlH_PXdMbVOQj9ETInx=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjrk3x88Kx5b51awg7EFCVLXsP9XCSZecDcxpov8zHm7d3AEqZkFOSeEUN_6LPCSCeKXoint9SPJKwJR2gzwFF-IkZ3HOQxsrKELWAtrsw0NiZagN8O9Nx4qBDVIo1Q2Zc64mA6gHBv5bHZA9nogVf5WAbGkdY5sEcoEM1l3t4nJfnHYVCALu__CiUE7uDD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjrk3x88Kx5b51awg7EFCVLXsP9XCSZecDcxpov8zHm7d3AEqZkFOSeEUN_6LPCSCeKXoint9SPJKwJR2gzwFF-IkZ3HOQxsrKELWAtrsw0NiZagN8O9Nx4qBDVIo1Q2Zc64mA6gHBv5bHZA9nogVf5WAbGkdY5sEcoEM1l3t4nJfnHYVCALu__CiUE7uDD=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div><br /></div></div></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Thiaⁿ-kóng múi 1 ê gín-á lóng ū un-loán ê ka-têng</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Thiⁿ-kong-peh--à ē phài un-jiû ê a-bú, chû-ài ê a-pah</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>chhiâⁿ kò͘ i ê kiáⁿ</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Nā khui-chhùi chhiùⁿ hit tè “Góa ê ka-têng chin khó-ài”</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Bí-lē ê khēng tō ē àn sim-koaⁿ-íⁿ-á ti̍t-ti̍t phû--chhut-lâi&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Thiaⁿ-kóng lâng ài chò m̄-tio̍h chiah ē hông chhú-hoa̍t</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Sī-án-chóaⁿ a-bú bô chò m̄-tio̍h siáⁿ tāi</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">A-pah ê kûn-thâu put-sî chhiūⁿ chheⁿ-kông-hō͘&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>lo̍h tī a-bú ê sin-khu-téng</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Kám sī a-pah ba̍k-chiu hoe-hoe kā a-bú tòng-chò soa-pau</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Chiah ē to-kong-kiàm-iáⁿ àn tēng-khok-khok ê kûn-thâu siā--chhut</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Góa ê a-pah ná ē hiah pháiⁿ</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Sim-chêng bô-ta-lí-ôa</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Thiaⁿ-kóng nā ū si̍t-kó͘ tō ē-sái chhōa a-bú poe lī khó͘-tòaⁿ jîn-seng</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Thiaⁿ-kóng nā sī kûn-thâu-bú piàn tēng sè-kài tō ē bô-kâng</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Thiaⁿ-kóng nā sī khah kín tōa-hàn ē-tàng kái-piàn it-chhè</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Ji̍t-chí hán-tit ū kúi-sî-á an-lêng</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Góa kan-na siūⁿ-beh chó͘-tòng ē hō͘ lâng lia̍h-kông ê kiaⁿ-hiâⁿ</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">A-pah</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Kám ē-sái mài koh phah góa ê a-bú, lí ê bó͘</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Kám ē-sái hêng góa 1 ê gín-á-lâng</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>kai ū ê pêng-chēng kap hēng-hok</span></span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2139\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahom